// URP's pass order in pseudocode:
//
// Setup()
//   → Clear color buffer to camera background color
//   → Clear depth buffer to far plane value
//
// ShadowPass()
//   → For each shadow-casting light:
//   →   Render depth from light's perspective to shadow map
//
// OpaquePass()
//   → Sort opaque objects front-to-back
//   → For each object: draw with lighting + shadows
//
// SkyboxPass()
//   → Draw skybox only where depth == far plane
//
// TransparentPass()
//   → Sort transparent objects back-to-front
//   → For each object: draw with alpha blending
//
// PostProcessingPass()
//   → Apply bloom, DOF, color grading, etc.
//
// Present()
//   → Swap buffers, show frame on screen

